<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and Gilts: Steady to weak. Demand moderate to good. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2   230-260 lbs. 59.00-60.00.</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.00 higher. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-400 lbs. 43.00-47.00</p>
<p>	   400-500 lbs. 46.00-48.00</p>
<p>	   500-600 lbs. 47.00-50.00, few 50.50</p>
<p>Few over 600 lbs. 49.00-50.00, few 50.50-51.00</p>
</text>
